Z||000000||MSBarney||06-25-2001||11:58 PM||||I'm new to this forum, and i dont really have a Fiero (but i wish i had). I've been reading about Fiero's for a few years now.<BR>And i was wondering if you people can help me out a bit, since im not a pro with cars (I only 18). The model that I really want to get is a Stardart 86 GT. My question is, how much would that model cost at this time? The reason im asking is cause in AutoTrader I see people wanting from 6K to 11K for an 86 GT. And a car dealer near my place wants 5900 for an Auto 86 GT. the prices ar Canadian by the way  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
