Z||000004||Monkeyman||06-26-2001||04:59 AM||||I think MSBarney wants a stick shift '86 GT.  MSBarney--that's what I've got.  Don't hold yourself to just an '86.  The '87 GT is almost identical (didn't the '87 have a rear sway bar?).  The '88 GT had a much better suspension/brakes, but if you're going to upgrade, you might want to go with an '86/'87.  Aftermarket parts are cheaper and you can build it up into something better than stock '88.<P>MM||||reg||1
