Z||000009||fierosound||06-28-2001||01:53 AM||||Try searching for Ontario Fieros using this site  <A HREF="http://www.trader.ca/search/default.asp?category=1&categoryid=1" TARGET=_blank>http://www.trader.ca/search/default.asp?category=1&categoryid=1</A> <P>By the way, 86s and 87s are identical, 88s had new suspension, rear sway bar and brakes.  Only 1086 87 GTs were sold in Canada, and only 423 88 GTs made it here.  Haven't got a number of 86s sold.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 06-28-2001).]||||reg||1
